            "notes": "##**Items & Powers**\n\nYour first core item which you will keep until the very last round is  [Overcharged Ordnance](item_f261877b-39e5-4248-aeca-7fe34de8ce10). This item increases the explosion radius of your mini-rockets, meaning that it will be easier to hit your targets during barrage, as you will notice. The increased splash damage also allows for easier multi-kills. Take  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) as your 2nd item. Sell  [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) and  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) \n\n##**Extra Cash ?**\n\n**More than $4000 :**",
