            "notes": "##**Items & Powers**\n'- Sell your greens'\n'- Buy  [Forward Shielding](item_d4e14a06-cff6-47f6-aba7-c9df420588f3) '\nTake   [Recursion Battery](item_88c3fb1a-2d38-4d2c-b439-6aadd038fd1a)  as your 2nd power. This is going to allow you to stay alive way longer during your barrages, since the more damage you do, the more you will heal.\n\n**Extra cash ?**\nOver $5000 :\n'-Buy  [Vitality Amplifier](item_6b52b1c9-a924-4a93-8545-a1c205cf6927) '\n\nUnder $5000 :\nStock up on greens, take  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) and  [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7), and if you still have cash take  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) .\n\n##**Playstyle**\n\nYou can now be way more aggressive in your plays, since your survivability is acceptable now. Instead of trading you should just flank, barrage a squishy, hide until you have barrage and health back, go in again (from the backline). You will still die against a hitscan if you don't kill him fast enough. If your team is struggling and you can't kill them all by yourself, try to melt the tank if it's not a D.Va, otherwise focus on the squishies as normal.",
