            "notes": "##**Items & Powers**\nIf you are agaisnt counters, you probably feel it's hard to survive after a barrage, even if you kill someone. That's why we take  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643), it still gives is  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) with extra  [Ability Lifesteal](stat_ability_lifesteal). If their heals are a problem and delay your kills, and you don't feel bothered not surviving as much, take  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) instead. If you bought  [Vitality Amplifier](item_6b52b1c9-a924-4a93-8545-a1c205cf6927), keep it, if not buy it. \n\n**Extra cash ?**\n\nOver $5000 :\n'- Sell  [Vitality Amplifier](item_6b52b1c9-a924-4a93-8545-a1c205cf6927) and buy  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) '\n\nOver $3000 :\n'- Sell  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) and buy  [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e)",
