            "notes": "##**Items & Powers**\n'-Sell  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) '\n'-Sell  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) '\n'-Buy  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e). This item gives you a good amout of  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power), and you can survive better during your ultimates'\n'-Buy  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8). This is a good replacement for  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643), as it gives you more  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and extra armor that regenerates whenever you use an ability.'\n\nFor your 3rd power, take  [Carpet Bomb](item_3c2ba051-0447-4a1c-8e07-8948136dff94). The increased duration is amazing since you just keep doing damage, you also keep healing. On top of that, your  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) is so strong that you just melt everyone in the lobby in seconds. Now if we double the duration of barrage, you could theoretically teamwipe with one good barrage, even if they're a little spread out. \n\n**Extra cash ?**\nOver $5000 :\nSell  [Vitality Amplifier](item_6b52b1c9-a924-4a93-8545-a1c205cf6927) and buy  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) \n\n\n##**Playstyle**\n\nFrom this round forward, you're pretty much unstopable. You melt eveything so quickly and you heal so much that you just have to survive and get 2-3 barrages on their team to win a fight (as long as you get picks of course). Flank even harder than before and use cover properly and you will win every round.",
